 r←Test_ProcessTool_005(stopFlag batchFlag);rc;parms;n;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "ProcessTool" with a tailored "Process" caption and check on <enter>. All "Items" are single chars.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.ProcessTool.CreateParms
 parms.posn←30 40
 parms.default←(1+⍳9)∊3 5
 parms.style←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.SelectionStyles.multi
 parms.processBtnCaption←'Do it - now!'
 parms.info←'Checks whether <enter> works with "processBtnCaption" set'
 n←parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.ProcessTool.Create(⍕¨1+⍳9)'∆HarvestSelections'
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'KeyPress' 'ER'
 0.5 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp'35'≢∊n.∆result
 n.List.SelItems←(1+⍳9)∊4 5 6
 n.∆result←⍬
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'KeyPress' 'ER'
 0.5 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp'456'≢∊n.∆result
 n.List.SelItems[]←0
 n.List.SelItems[3]←1
 n.∆result←⍬
 ⎕NQ n.∆Form'KeyPress' 'ER'
 0.5 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →GoToTidyUp(,'4')≢∊n.∆result
 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
